# Origin of the indexer API — the ORIGIN ONLY, with no /v1 and no trailing
# slash, e.g. https://api.indexer.piggygang.net.
# The version prefix lives in the request path (`/v1/collections`), not here; a
# value ending in /v1 would request /v1/v1/collections. lib/indexer.ts strips one
# and warns rather than shipping a silently numberless page, but fix the value.
#
# Optional: unset means production, so a fresh clone and a zero-config Vercel
# import both work with no environment at all. Note this is the OPPOSITE of the
# Explorer's API_BASE_URL, where unset means in-process mock fixtures — hence the
# different name.
#
# Server-only on purpose: the collections strip is fetched in a Server
# Component, so this never reaches the browser.
INDEXER_API_URL=
